--+--------+-+# GL₃ Tropical Satake Surjectivity — Definitions
--+--------+-+
--+--------+-+This file provides the foundational definitions for the GL₃ tropical Satake
--+--------+-+surjectivity theorem: dominant coweights, support data, tropical Hecke functions,
