------+---+--+  `kthLargest s k = max_{|S|=k+1} min_{i ∈ S} s(i)`
------+---+--+
------+---+--+This definition is proof-friendly because the perturbation bound follows directly
------+---+--+from the monotonicity of inf and sup operations.
------+---+-- -/
