------+---+--+    For `k ≥ 1`, this measures the separation between the top-k scores and the rest.
------+---+--+    `topkGap s k = kthLargest s (k-1) - kthLargest s k` -/
------+---+--+def topkGap {C : ℕ} (s : Fin C → ℝ) (k : ℕ) : ℝ :=
------+---+--+  kthLargest s (k - 1) - kthLargest s k
